WEBVTT

00:50:54.704 --> 00:51:00.204
how can we be confident that they don't
lead to this sort of system crashing

00:51:00.204 --> 00:51:01.496
basically in some way?

00:51:03.163 --> 00:51:06.996
I think that I've heard a lot
of behavioral psychologists

00:51:06.996 --> 00:51:10.496
and other people that have studied
this say in different ways,

00:51:10.496 --> 00:51:12.496
are that I hate to keep
picking on Facebook,

00:51:12.496 --> 00:51:14.704
but we can do it one more time
since we're on the topic.

00:51:15.371 --> 00:51:19.538
Maybe you can't in any given moment in
night where you're tired and you have

00:51:19.538 --> 00:51:24.038
a stressful day, stop yourself from
the dopamine hit of scrolling

00:51:24.038 --> 00:51:27.204
and Instagram, even though you
know that's bad for you

00:51:27.204 --> 00:51:28.829
and it's not leading to your best life.

00:51:29.288 --> 00:51:33.204
But if you were asked in a reflective
moment where you were sort of fully alert